	quest.5CED58896AEFF1B9.title: "Era 1: Mechanical Reconstruction"
	quest.5CED58896AEFF1B9.quest_desc: ["The furnace proved that survivors can build together. Era 1 turns isolated labor into repeatable mechanical systems." "Choose Mining, Farming, or Exploration as the team’s main route. The three vertical chains are alternatives; gear-shaped quests are optional supporting lessons." "Specialize without isolating yourselves. Ore, food, and recovered knowledge become civilization only when they meet." ]
	task.429213D0BFB63318.title: "Review the three Era 1 routes"
	quest.0FBD84DA6EE9BC4A.title: "Stone for the First Machines"
	quest.0FBD84DA6EE9BC4A.quest_desc: ["Use JEI to inspect the exact pack-modified recipe and every upstream processing step before committing scarce materials." "Objective: obtain 64 × Andesite. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.621272525080C5D4.title: "Bind Stone to Motion"
	quest.621272525080C5D4.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 8 × Andesite Alloy. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.025AD5200EE5F3D8.title: "The Drill Does Not Tire"
	quest.025AD5200EE5F3D8.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Mechanical Drill. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.22DA14A4938C3EFF.title: "Reach the Deep Workings"
	quest.22DA14A4938C3EFF.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Rope Pulley. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.69C4F2B1AE2210C2.title: "Crush Before Smelting"
	quest.69C4F2B1AE2210C2.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 16 × Crushed Raw Iron. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.3E3CEA4E57FC937C.title: "Iron Under Compression"
	quest.3E3CEA4E57FC937C.quest_desc: ["Use JEI to inspect the exact pack-modified recipe and every upstream processing step before committing scarce materials." "Objective: obtain 1 × Iron Block 1x. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.0D4648AA45CF0D31.title: "Fuel the Mechanical Shift"
	quest.0D4648AA45CF0D31.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 16 × Coal Block; 32 × Crushed Raw Iron. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.2A949BE9EDFDCE3D.title: "Mechanical Mining Charter"
	quest.2A949BE9EDFDCE3D.quest_desc: ["Use JEI to inspect the exact pack-modified recipe and every upstream processing step before committing scarce materials." "Objective: obtain 1 × Era1 Mining Contribution. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.08F0F7419B76EB35.title: "The First Reliable Harvest"
	quest.08F0F7419B76EB35.quest_desc: ["Use JEI to inspect the exact pack-modified recipe and every upstream processing step before committing scarce materials." "Objective: obtain 32 × Wheat; 16 × Wheat Seeds. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.40D7DBB376956DA5.title: "Food Is a Process"
	quest.40D7DBB376956DA5.quest_desc: ["Farmer’s Delight turns raw harvests into reliable meals. Use JEI to inspect both the workstation and every ingredient so food production remains renewable." "Objective: obtain 1 × Cutting Board. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
