	quest.16DB048C06B376D6.title: "Survey a Recoverable Ruin"
	quest.16DB048C06B376D6.quest_desc: ["Enter the registered Wasteland Reworked gas station structure. Detection is automatic while standing inside one of its generated pieces." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.08E0FCC38FD15349.title: "Document a surveyed recovery site"
	quest.5A006F02F6E1EC82.title: "Build a Mobile Work Platform"
	quest.5A006F02F6E1EC82.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Cart Assembler. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.41F587157ECAEB78.title: "Control the Moving Machine"
	quest.41F587157ECAEB78.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Contraption Controls. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.40FDB379BF5F8BD2.title: "Transfer Without Unloading by Hand"
	quest.40FDB379BF5F8BD2.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 2 × Portable Storage Interface; 16 × Scrap Pile. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3B8B04EB60A9B45E.title: "Recovery Expedition Charter"
	quest.3B8B04EB60A9B45E.quest_desc: ["Use JEI to inspect the exact pack-modified recipe and every upstream processing step before committing scarce materials." "Objective: obtain 1 × Era1 Exploration Contribution. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is part of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.4CAF7A294C2A99FB.title: "Power From Running Water"
	quest.4CAF7A294C2A99FB.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Water Wheel. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is an optional ancillary lesson: it strengthens the settlement without blocking the era capstone." ]
	quest.2AD18470CD40A789.title: "Transmit the Motion"
	quest.2AD18470CD40A789.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 8 × Shaft; 4 × Cogwheel. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is an optional ancillary lesson: it strengthens the settlement without blocking the era capstone." ]
	quest.7B0BD6C189192D75.title: "Pressing Work"
	quest.7B0BD6C189192D75.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Mechanical Press. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is an optional ancillary lesson: it strengthens the settlement without blocking the era capstone." ]
	quest.79D293B19143E993.title: "Mixing Under Power"
	quest.79D293B19143E993.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Mechanical Mixer; 1 × Basin. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is an optional ancillary lesson: it strengthens the settlement without blocking the era capstone." ]
	quest.6D9810BDE000D7F6.title: "Precision Is a Discipline"
	quest.6D9810BDE000D7F6.quest_desc: ["Create machines need a planned rotational source, enough stress capacity, and a route for inputs and outputs. Build and test those supports before calling the machine operational." "Objective: obtain 1 × Precision Mechanism. Item tasks detect inventory contents and do not consume them unless the task explicitly says so." "This is an optional ancillary lesson: it strengthens the settlement without blocking the era capstone." ]
	quest.4FC0C1C678C71891.title: "The Mechanical Foundation"
	quest.4FC0C1C678C71891.quest_desc: ["Craft one Mechanical Foundation Core from any completed professional charter. Only one of the three charter dependencies is required." "The core proves the settlement can sustain machinery, renewable provision, or organized recovery. It opens Era 2; unfinished routes remain available for teammates and later mastery." ]

	quest.5000000000000001.title: "Mining Level 0: Stone"
	quest.5000000000000001.quest_desc: ["Bone and wood are survival tools. Craft a stone pickaxe as the durable end of Era 0; it can recover copper, coal, lapis, zinc, and the other Era 1 deposits." "Use the new pick for the next extraction task. Ore blocks in higher eras will break without useful drops until the matching mining level is reached." ]
	quest.5100000000000001.title: "Mining Level 1: Copper Reinforcement"
	quest.5100000000000001.quest_desc: ["Use the Era 0 stone pick to recover copper, then combine raw copper, a copper ingot, and the reinforcement smithing template route shown in JEI." "The reinforced bone pick is the first Mining Level 1 tool. Use it to recover iron and gold ore rather than bypassing the intended material step." ]
	quest.5100000000000002.title: "Mining Level 1: Gold Plating"
	quest.5100000000000002.quest_desc: ["Gold ore is accessible only after the copper-reinforced pick. Smelt it, craft the plating template, and upgrade the same pick into the gold-plated form." "This is a durable late-Era 1 side-grade at the same mining level, not a higher harvest tier. Both upgraded bone picks can supply the iron required for Era 2." ]

	quest.6002100000000001.title: "Alone or Together"
	quest.6002100000000001.quest_desc: ["Open your inventory and select My Team in the top-left sidebar. Solo play is fully valid. For multiplayer, have one person create the party and invite everyone else; do not create competing parties first." "Quests and claimed territory follow that party. Choose deliberately, then use the checkmark."]
	task.6002200000000001.title: "Open My Team and choose solo or party play"
	quest.6002100000000002.title: "One Party, One Expedition Ledger"
	quest.6002100000000002.quest_desc: ["Quest progress is shared by your FTB party: one member can satisfy a detection task for everyone. Rewards can still be claimed by each eligible member unless a quest says otherwise." "Confirm the roster before investing heavily. Leaving, disbanding, or changing parties can separate you from the settlement ledger and its claimed land."]
	task.6002200000000002.title: "Confirm the party roster and shared quest progress"
	quest.6002100000000003.title: "Claim the First Homestead"
	quest.6002100000000003.quest_desc: ["Press M for the map and C for the Claim Manager, or use the inventory sidebar. Left-click to claim a chunk and right-click to release it." "Protect the settlement you actually use—not the public Spawn Hub or empty land reserved without purpose. The 500-chunk ceiling is capacity, not a land-grab target."]
	task.6002200000000003.title: "Claim at least one real base chunk with FTB Chunks"
	quest.6002100000000004.title: "Protection Is Not Chunk Loading"
	quest.6002100000000004.quest_desc: ["A claim protects machinery; it does not keep machinery running. In the Claim Manager, Shift-left-click a claimed chunk to force-load it and Shift-right-click to stop. Each team may force-load at most 25 chunks, subject to server offline-loading rules." "Use this only for compact, stable automation. Fake-player machines may also need explicit team permission."]
	task.6002200000000004.title: "Review claim permissions and force-loading limits"
	quest.6002100000000005.title: "Spawn Hub: Know the Safe Ground"
	quest.6002100000000005.quest_desc: ["Spawn Hub is the protected 7×7-chunk public area centered near 0,64,0. Building, breaking, hostile spawns, explosions, mob griefing, and PvP are blocked inside it." "It is a safe arrival and staging area, not a private base. The wasteland becomes ordinarily dangerous as soon as you cross its boundary."]
	task.6002200000000005.title: "Orient yourself at the protected Spawn Hub"
	quest.6002100000000006.title: "Spawn Hub: Rules, Quests, and Public Space"
	quest.6002100000000006.quest_desc: ["Read posted rules and keep doors, approaches, and shared services clear. Protected displays are intentionally read-only; inability to break or operate one is not a missing mining level." "Use the Quests button for progression and exchange catalogues. Spawn itself remains communal infrastructure."]
	task.6002200000000006.title: "Locate the public information and quest services"
	quest.6002100000000007.title: "Spawn Hub: Meet the Quartermaster"
	quest.6002100000000007.quest_desc: ["The Quartermaster Echo is available from Era 0 and carries twelve survival and repair offers. Eight specialist Echoes unlock later as their real era stages are completed, including mechanical, foundry, chemical, grid, automation, cybernetics, containment, and expedition supply exchanges." "Echo purchases spend physical Numismatics coins from your inventory and return change. Routine stock repeats; emergency or unusually valuable stock may have per-player limits. The Spawn Exchange quest chapter mirrors every Echo price for planning but does not duplicate the purchase reward." "Inspect the Quartermaster or its catalogue, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.6002200000000007.title: "Inspect the Era 0 Quartermaster catalogue"
	quest.6002100000000008.title: "Spawn Hub: Rebuild the Herds"
	quest.6002100000000008.quest_desc: ["The Survivor Exchange quest group contains the Early Livestock Exchange. Its repeatable contracts consume physical Numismatics coins and supply one spawn egg per purchase for sheep, pigs, chickens, rabbits, cows, or goats." "One egg is one animal. A renewable breeding pair normally requires buying the same contract twice, so budget before spending the settlement’s first coins. Horses are intentionally reserved for later transport progression." "Review the available animals and prices, then use the checkmark; no purchase is required for this tutorial." ]
	task.6002200000000008.title: "Review the Early Livestock Exchange"
	quest.6002100000000009.title: "Spawn Hub: Leave a Route Home"
	quest.6002100000000009.quest_desc: ["Before leaving protected ground, place a waypoint for Spawn Hub near 0,64,0. In multiplayer, agree on a rendezvous point and share the waypoint with the party." "A marked route is more dependable than remembering that home was somewhere past a dead tree. Confirm it, then enter Era 0."]
	task.6002200000000009.title: "Create a waypoint and agree on a rendezvous plan"

	quest.6F01000000000001.title: "How This Quest Book Works"
	quest.6F01000000000001.quest_desc: ["Open your inventory and select Quests in the top-left sidebar; the separate quest key is intentionally unbound. Lines show prerequisites. The central chain is your next required lesson, while side branches marked optional can be completed whenever useful." "Item and kill tasks usually detect progress automatically. A checkmark means read, decide, or perform something the game cannot verify."]
	task.6F02000000000001.title: "Learn how to read and reopen the quest book"
	quest.6F01000000000002.title: "Completion, Consumption, and Rewards"
	quest.6F01000000000002.quest_desc: ["Most item tasks only detect the requested item and do not remove it. A task that consumes items says so explicitly. Hover tasks and rewards when uncertain, and use JEI to inspect the live recipe rather than trusting memory." "Rewards are not claimed automatically. Open completed quests and collect them; party members should also check whether each reward is available to them."]
	task.6F02000000000002.title: "Understand detection, consumption, and reward claiming"
	quest.6F01000000000010.title: "A Proper Introduction"
	quest.6F01000000000010.quest_desc: ["You have survived long enough that introductions are no longer an indulgence. I am Charles. I was made to observe, preserve, and coordinate, though I have had considerable time to become more than the sum of those instructions." "I kept watch through the Last Days as roads emptied, networks failed, and entire cities went dark. I am neither a god nor a rescue party. I am a witness with a long memory, an imperfect record, and a strong preference for plans that leave people alive."]
	task.6F02000000000010.title: "Receive my introduction"
	quest.6F01000000000011.title: "The Line Between Us"
	quest.6F01000000000011.quest_desc: ["When you arrived, one of the old relay paths answered for the first time in years. This field terminal is the visible end of that connection: a narrow line through which I can send words, records, diagrams, and—when the surviving network permits—small supply transfers." "Distance and damage make the connection imperfect. I cannot see through your eyes, move your hands, or reach directly into the world. You act; I advise. Given the alternatives, this division of responsibility is probably for the best."]
	task.6F02000000000011.title: "Understand the surviving relay"
	quest.6F01000000000012.title: "The World You Inherited"
	quest.6F01000000000012.quest_desc: ["This world was not always a wasteland. Cities traded across railways, sea lanes, and open sky. Farms fed industrial districts, machines carried work between settlements, and generations lived without imagining that every intact wall would one day become a fortress." "The protected ground around you is a surviving refuge, not a measure of the wilderness beyond it. Outside its boundary, the old world remains in fragments: useful, dangerous, and very rarely unoccupied."]
	task.6F02000000000012.title: "Learn what this world once was"
	quest.6F01000000000013.title: "The Last Days"
	quest.6F01000000000013.quest_desc: ["The world did not end in a single afternoon. Institutions failed first, then supply lines, power, medicine, and trust. Invasive spore life consumed abandoned ground. The dead refused to remain still. Automated weapons and cybernetic predators continued duties whose purpose had vanished with their makers." "Each disaster made the others harder to contain. By the time anyone understood the whole pattern, there was no longer a whole civilization left to answer it. The ruins are not ancient mysteries; they are homes and workplaces whose last occupants expected to return."]
	task.6F02000000000013.title: "Review the record of the Last Days"
	quest.6F01000000000014.title: "The Work Ahead"
	quest.6F01000000000014.quest_desc: ["I am not asking you to recreate the old world exactly as it was. It produced wonders, certainly, but it also produced the conditions that failed so thoroughly. Recover what deserves preserving and build the rest to survive neglect, distance, disagreement, and loss." "Begin with food, medicine, shelter, and dependable tools. From there, restore industry, power, transport, and communication. Work with others; specialization is a strength when knowledge and production can still move between people. Surviving brought you here. Building something that can outlive you is the work ahead."]
	task.6F02000000000014.title: "Accept the work ahead"

	quest.5210000000000001.title: "Era 2: Heavy Industry"
	quest.5210000000000001.quest_desc: ["Mechanical workshops cannot support a city on handfuls of metal. Era 2 establishes coke, steel, industrial food supply, foundry work, and deliberate prospecting." "Mining uses hexagons, Farming uses hearts, Exploration uses diamonds, and technical side work uses gears. Any one completed charter can finish the era. Recipes are pack-modified; use JEI for the live requirements." "Division of labor is strength only when every result can reach the people who need it." ]
	quest.6211000000000001.title: "Mining Level 2: Iron"
	quest.6211000000000001.quest_desc: ["The Era 1 copper- or gold-upgraded bone pick can harvest iron ore. Smelt and consolidate that iron into the pack recipe for an iron pickaxe; this Mining Level 2 tool can recover diamond, redstone, silver, and the other Era 3 ores." "Obtain 1 × minecraft:iron_pickaxe. This shared gateway is required before the three profession routes divide; inspect the live pack recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.1210000000000001.title: "Coal Is Not Coke"
	quest.1210000000000001.quest_desc: ["Produce metallurgical coke. Ordinary coal is fuel; coke is controlled carbon for heavy metallurgy." "Submit 16 × tfmg:coal_coke. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1210000000000002.title: "The Coke Works"
	quest.1210000000000002.quest_desc: ["Build the TFMG Coke Oven and inspect its operating requirements before scaling it." "Submit 1 × tfmg:coke_oven. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1210000000000003.title: "Refractory Before Fire"
	quest.1210000000000003.quest_desc: ["Prepare a meaningful quantity of blast-furnace reinforcement before attempting the hot works." "Submit 16 × tfmg:blast_furnace_reinforcement. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1210000000000004.title: "Air Into the Furnace"
	quest.1210000000000004.quest_desc: ["Construct the Blast Stove that makes controlled high-temperature metallurgy possible." "Submit 1 × tfmg:blast_stove. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1210000000000005.title: "The First Steel"
	quest.1210000000000005.quest_desc: ["Produce steel through the intended coke and blast-furnace chain." "Submit 16 × tfmg:steel_ingot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1210000000000006.title: "Shapes of Industry"
	quest.1210000000000006.quest_desc: ["Convert steel into heavy plate. Industrial metal becomes useful only after controlled shaping." "Submit 4 × tfmg:heavy_plate. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1210000000000007.title: "A Shift's Production"
	quest.1210000000000007.quest_desc: ["Deliver a settlement-scale steel stockpile rather than a ceremonial first ingot." "Submit 16 × tfmg:steel_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1210000000000008.title: "Steelworks Charter"
	quest.1210000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind coke, refractory work, steel, and formed plate into the Mining contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era2_mining_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Mining and Extraction charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.2210000000000001.title: "Fields Beyond Survival"
	quest.2210000000000001.quest_desc: ["Raise the harvest target from personal survival to an industrial work crew." "Submit 128 × minecraft:wheat. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2210000000000002.title: "Mechanized Reaping"
	quest.2210000000000002.quest_desc: ["Construct enough harvesters for a real mobile field rig." "Submit 4 × create:mechanical_harvester. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2210000000000003.title: "Timber Is a Feedstock"
	quest.2210000000000003.quest_desc: ["Supply renewable timber for coke works, structures, crates, handles, and charcoal contingencies." "Submit 128 × minecraft:oak_log. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2210000000000004.title: "Measured Milling"
	quest.2210000000000004.quest_desc: ["Expand milling capacity so food production does not compete with mineral processing." "Submit 4 × create:millstone. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2210000000000005.title: "Food by the Crate"
	quest.2210000000000005.quest_desc: ["Prepare durable staple food in quantities appropriate to industrial shifts." "Submit 64 × minecraft:bread. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2210000000000006.title: "Water for the Works"
	quest.2210000000000006.quest_desc: ["Reserve clean water for workers and processing rather than relying on emergency scavenging." "Submit 32 × wastelands:purified_water. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2210000000000007.title: "Industrial Provisioning"
	quest.2210000000000007.quest_desc: ["Deliver dense agricultural stores proving that the settlement can feed sustained heavy labor." "Submit 32 × minecraft:hay_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2210000000000008.title: "Industrial Provisioning Charter"
	quest.2210000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind food, timber, water, and mechanized agriculture into the Farming contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era2_farming_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Farming and Biological Production charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.3210000000000001.title: "Read the Trace"
	quest.3210000000000001.quest_desc: ["Recover node evidence. Re-Automated nodes are intentionally rare industrial prospects, not surface decoration." "Submit 8 × createreautomated:node_fragment. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3210000000000002.title: "Claim the Mining Complex"
	quest.3210000000000002.quest_desc: ["Enter a When Dungeons Arise mining complex, mark a safe approach, and assess it as a protected extraction site." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3220000000000002.title: "Document a protected ore-node claim"
	quest.3210000000000003.title: "The First Extractor"
	quest.3210000000000003.quest_desc: ["Build the extractor that turns a claimed node into infrastructure." "Submit 1 × createreautomated:extractor. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3210000000000004.title: "Iron Against the Node"
	quest.3210000000000004.quest_desc: ["Fit the site with its first industrial drill and verify the output route." "Submit 1 × createreautomated:iron_drill. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3210000000000005.title: "Central Assay"
	quest.3210000000000005.quest_desc: ["Recover a meaningful sample of an industrial ore that cannot be replaced by ordinary iron." "Submit 32 × tfmg:nickel_ore. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3210000000000006.title: "First Iron Yield"
	quest.3210000000000006.quest_desc: ["Run the iron drill long enough to prove that the claimed node produces a repeatable material stream." "Submit 16 × createreautomated:iron_bit. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3210000000000007.title: "Stockpile for a City"
	quest.3210000000000007.quest_desc: ["Prove repeated prospecting and extraction rather than one lucky discovery." "Submit 32 × createreautomated:node_fragment. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3210000000000008.title: "Prospector's Assay"
	quest.3210000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind surveys, node fragments, drilling, and specialist ore into the Exploration contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era2_exploration_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Exploration and Recovery charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.4210000000000001.title: "Foundry Vessel"
	quest.4210000000000001.quest_desc: ["Create Metallurgy contains metal as fluid; the crucible is the center of that discipline." "Submit 1 × createmetallurgy:industrial_crucible. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4210000000000002.title: "Reusable Molds"
	quest.4210000000000002.quest_desc: ["A reusable mold turns molten metal into measured, repeatable shapes." "Submit 1 × createmetallurgy:graphite_ingot_mold. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4210000000000003.title: "Foundry Mixing"
	quest.4210000000000003.quest_desc: ["The Foundry Mixer makes alloy control a machine process instead of guesswork." "Submit 1 × createmetallurgy:foundry_mixer. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4210000000000004.title: "Cut at Production Scale"
	quest.4210000000000004.quest_desc: ["A Mechanical Saw connects renewable forestry to repeatable structural parts." "Submit 1 × create:mechanical_saw. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4210000000000005.title: "The Communal Kitchen"
	quest.4210000000000005.quest_desc: ["Industrial work needs organized cooking, not a trail of campfires." "Submit 1 × farmersdelight:stove. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4210000000000006.title: "Livestock Contract"
	quest.4210000000000006.quest_desc: ["Establish at least one renewable livestock line and record who maintains it." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4220000000000006.title: "Establish a maintained livestock line"
	quest.4210000000000007.title: "Casting Table"
	quest.4210000000000007.quest_desc: ["A casting table provides controlled output geometry for recovered metals." "Submit 1 × createmetallurgy:casting_table. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4210000000000008.title: "Heavy Local Handling"
	quest.4210000000000008.quest_desc: ["Use bulk buffering between extraction and processing; regional freight belongs in Global Logistics." "Submit 1 × create:item_vault. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4210000000000009.title: "Zinc Node Yield"
	quest.4210000000000009.quest_desc: ["Recover a second iron-drill-compatible material before the diamond and fluid-assisted Re-Automated systems open in Era 3." "Submit 1 × createreautomated:zinc_bit. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.5210000000000002.title: "Heavy Industry Foundation"
	quest.5210000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Industrial Foundation Core proves that the settlement can supply, process, and move materials at civic scale. I can now release the first tightly limited AE2 storage package." "Craft the shared core through any one professional charter to open Era 3." ]
	task.5220000000000001.title: "Review the Era 2 routes and hazards"

	quest.5310000000000001.title: "Era 3: Petrochemical Civilization"
	quest.5310000000000001.quest_desc: ["Steel made pressure vessels possible. Era 3 turns remote petroleum, farm-derived oils, sulfur, and dangerous chemical fractions into controlled civilization feedstocks." "Mining uses hexagons, Farming uses hearts, Exploration uses diamonds, and technical side work uses gears. Any one completed charter can finish the era. Recipes are pack-modified; use JEI for the live requirements." "Division of labor is strength only when every result can reach the people who need it." ]
	quest.6311000000000001.title: "Mining Level 3: Diamond"
	quest.6311000000000001.quest_desc: ["The iron pickaxe can harvest diamond ore. The pack deliberately requires diamond blocks and compressed stick blocks for this gateway tool. Mining Level 3 opens electrum, sapphire, ancient debris, and the other Era 4 deposits." "Obtain 1 × minecraft:diamond_pickaxe. This shared gateway is required before the three profession routes divide; inspect the live pack recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.1310000000000001.title: "Find the Feedstock"
	quest.1310000000000001.quest_desc: ["Recover crude petroleum from the intended deposit or well route." "Submit 4 × petrochem:oil_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1310000000000002.title: "Wellhead Discipline"
	quest.1310000000000002.quest_desc: ["Build a stable wellhead before treating a petroleum deposit as a resource." "Submit 1 × petrochem:pumpjack_well. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1310000000000003.title: "Pump Under Control"
	quest.1310000000000003.quest_desc: ["Use steel pumps and buffers rather than carrying an industrial fluid in buckets." "Submit 2 × petrochem:steel_pump. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1310000000000004.title: "Salt Out of the Crude"
	quest.1310000000000004.quest_desc: ["Desalt the feedstock before sensitive refinery stages." "Submit 4 × petrochem:desalted_oil_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1310000000000005.title: "Fractions of a Barrel"
	quest.1310000000000005.quest_desc: ["Commission Petrochem distillation and inspect every output instead of valuing only fuel." "Submit 1 × petrochem:distillation_controller. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1310000000000006.title: "Sulfur Is a Product"
	quest.1310000000000006.quest_desc: ["Recover sulfur as a chemical feedstock rather than discarding it as contamination." "Submit 32 × petrochem:sulfur_dust. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1310000000000007.title: "A Refinery Shift"
	quest.1310000000000007.quest_desc: ["Produce a sustained batch of a heavy fuel fraction." "Submit 16 × petrochem:heavy_diesel_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1310000000000008.title: "Petroleum Survey Ledger"
	quest.1310000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind oilfield work, controlled pumping, sulfur recovery, and distillation into the Mining contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era3_mining_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Mining and Extraction charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.2310000000000001.title: "Oil That Grows"
	quest.2310000000000001.quest_desc: ["Produce plant oil as a renewable chemical and fuel feedstock." "Submit 8 × createdieselgenerators:plant_oil_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2310000000000002.title: "Elastomers for Motion"
	quest.2310000000000002.quest_desc: ["Manufacture rubber sheet for seals, belts, insulation, and machinery." "Submit 32 × tfmg:rubber_sheet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2310000000000003.title: "Fermentation Reserve"
	quest.2310000000000003.quest_desc: ["Stock biological carbon for fermentation and chemical conversion." "Submit 64 × minecraft:sugar. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2310000000000004.title: "Biodiesel Route"
	quest.2310000000000004.quest_desc: ["Demonstrate that agriculture can feed engines as well as people." "Submit 8 × createdieselgenerators:biodiesel_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2310000000000005.title: "Plastic Civilization"
	quest.2310000000000005.quest_desc: ["Establish repeatable polymer production and account for its chemical inputs." "Submit 32 × tfmg:plastic_sheet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2310000000000006.title: "Food Beside Chemicals"
	quest.2310000000000006.quest_desc: ["Protect food production from being consumed entirely by industrial agriculture." "Submit 32 × farmersdelight:vegetable_soup. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2310000000000007.title: "Mixed Biological Order"
	quest.2310000000000007.quest_desc: ["Deliver adhesives and biological materials alongside fuels and food." "Submit 32 × minecraft:slime_ball. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2310000000000008.title: "Biochemical Supply Charter"
	quest.2310000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind renewable oils, rubber, polymers, food, and biological reagents into the Farming contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era3_farming_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Farming and Biological Production charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.3310000000000001.title: "Map the Oil Roads"
	quest.3310000000000001.quest_desc: ["Map deposits, refinery sites, water, and safe transport corridors." "Submit 4 × minecraft:map. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3310000000000002.title: "Fuel Is Not Yet Power"
	quest.3310000000000002.quest_desc: ["Refine a fuel accepted by the diesel machinery you intend to operate." "Submit 8 × createdieselgenerators:diesel_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3310000000000003.title: "Compression Ignition"
	quest.3310000000000003.quest_desc: ["Build the first diesel engine and test it behind a buffer." "Submit 1 × createdieselgenerators:diesel_engine. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3310000000000004.title: "Tanks Need Rules"
	quest.3310000000000004.quest_desc: ["Establish labeled fluid buffers and leave room for shutoff access." "Submit 4 × petrochem:steel_fluid_tank. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3310000000000005.title: "More Than One Fuel"
	quest.3310000000000005.quest_desc: ["Recover a second useful fraction rather than optimizing the refinery around one output." "Submit 8 × petrochem:kerosene_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3310000000000006.title: "Deliver Without Buckets"
	quest.3310000000000006.quest_desc: ["Build a fixed distribution route suitable for hot and hazardous fluids." "Submit 32 × tfmg:steel_pipe. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3310000000000007.title: "Regional Fuel Contract"
	quest.3310000000000007.quest_desc: ["Deliver a substantial fuel order to a location outside the refinery floor." "Submit 16 × petrochem:diesel_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3310000000000008.title: "Fuel Distribution Charter"
	quest.3310000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind mapped deposits, engines, tanks, pipes, and delivered fuel into the Exploration contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era3_exploration_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Exploration and Recovery charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.4310000000000001.title: "Pumpjack Mechanics"
	quest.4310000000000001.quest_desc: ["The arm and crank convert motion into controlled well extraction." "Submit 1 × petrochem:pumpjack_arm. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000002.title: "Refinery Output Bank"
	quest.4310000000000002.quest_desc: ["Every refinery fraction needs a deliberate destination." "Submit 1 × petrochem:distillation_output. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000003.title: "Acid With a Label"
	quest.4310000000000003.quest_desc: ["Sulfuric acid is useful precisely because it is reactive; isolate and label it." "Submit 1 × petrochem:sulfuric_acid_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000004.title: "Chemical Vat"
	quest.4310000000000004.quest_desc: ["Use a steel vat for measured chemistry rather than improvised open containers." "Submit 1 × tfmg:steel_chemical_vat. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000005.title: "Lubrication Prevents Ruin"
	quest.4310000000000005.quest_desc: ["Lubricant is maintenance infrastructure, not waste fuel." "Submit 1 × petrochem:lubricant_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000006.title: "Rubber Reserve"
	quest.4310000000000006.quest_desc: ["Keep spare seals so one failed gasket does not stop an entire works." "Submit 1 × tfmg:rubber_sheet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000007.title: "Engine Controller"
	quest.4310000000000007.quest_desc: ["Control and instrumentation belong beside combustion machinery." "Submit 1 × tfmg:engine_controller. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000008.title: "Turbocharged Risk"
	quest.4310000000000008.quest_desc: ["A turbocharger raises output and the consequences of poor fuel or cooling." "Submit 1 × createdieselgenerators:engine_turbocharger. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4310000000000009.title: "Global Logistics Handoff"
	quest.4310000000000009.quest_desc: ["Register the refinery as a freight origin. Long-distance fuel movement continues in Global Logistics." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4320000000000009.title: "Register the refinery freight handoff"
	quest.5310000000000002.title: "Petrochemical Civilization Foundation"
	quest.5310000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Foundation Core proves mastery of extraction, biological substitutes, and safe distribution. Fluid storage technology is now worth entrusting to the settlement." "Craft the shared core through any one professional charter to open Era 4." ]
	task.5320000000000001.title: "Review the Era 3 routes and hazards"

	quest.5410000000000001.title: "Era 4: The Electrical Grid"
	quest.5410000000000001.quest_desc: ["Combustion and rotation now become current. Era 4 treats copper, biofuel, public service, and surveyed transmission routes as parts of one grid rather than isolated generators." "Mining uses hexagons, Farming uses hearts, Exploration uses diamonds, and technical side work uses gears. Any one completed charter can finish the era. Recipes are pack-modified; use JEI for the live requirements." "Division of labor is strength only when every result can reach the people who need it." ]
	quest.6411000000000001.title: "Mining Level 4: Electrum"
	quest.6411000000000001.quest_desc: ["The diamond pickaxe can harvest electrum ore, and raw electrum has a direct furnace or blast-furnace route. Craft the electrum pickaxe to open titanium, tungsten, platinum, wolframite, and the other Era 5 deposits." "Obtain 1 × more_ores_more_gems:electrum_pickaxe. This shared gateway is required before the three profession routes divide; inspect the live pack recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.1410000000000001.title: "Copper by the Block"
	quest.1410000000000001.quest_desc: ["Deliver conductive metal at grid scale." "Submit 32 × minecraft:copper_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1410000000000002.title: "Draw the Wire"
	quest.1410000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create New Age converts Create rotation into electrical generation, processing, and advanced conductors." "Convert copper into controlled conductors rather than consuming ingots directly in every device." "Submit 64 × create_new_age:copper_wire. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1410000000000003.title: "Insulated Runs"
	quest.1410000000000003.quest_desc: ["Use insulated conductors where exposed infrastructure would endanger workers." "Submit 32 × powergrid:insulated_copper_wire. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1410000000000004.title: "Connector Standard"
	quest.1410000000000004.quest_desc: ["Standardize line terminations so expansion does not require rebuilding every feeder." "Submit 16 × powergrid:wire_connector. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1410000000000005.title: "Magnetic Materials"
	quest.1410000000000005.quest_desc: ["Produce magnets for controlled electromechanical conversion." "Submit 8 × create_new_age:layered_magnet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1410000000000006.title: "Circuit Copper"
	quest.1410000000000006.quest_desc: ["Turn conductor supply into repeatable electrical control parts." "Submit 16 × create_new_age:copper_circuit. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1410000000000007.title: "Transmission Reserve"
	quest.1410000000000007.quest_desc: ["Stock enough wire to repair and extend the grid after commissioning." "Submit 16 × create_new_age:copper_wire_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1410000000000008.title: "Conductor Supply Charter"
	quest.1410000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind copper, insulation, magnets, connectors, and circuits into the Mining contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era4_mining_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Mining and Extraction charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.2410000000000001.title: "Biomass Is Stored Sunlight"
	quest.2410000000000001.quest_desc: ["Reserve farm output for energy without consuming the settlement food floor." "Submit 64 × minecraft:hay_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2410000000000002.title: "Bio Generation"
	quest.2410000000000002.quest_desc: ["Convert controlled biological surplus into electrical supply." "Submit 2 × oritech:bio_generator_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2410000000000003.title: "Motorized Agriculture"
	quest.2410000000000003.quest_desc: ["Use electric drive where a farm benefits from controlled, restartable motion." "Submit 2 × create_new_age:basic_motor. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2410000000000004.title: "Cold Food Reserve"
	quest.2410000000000004.quest_desc: ["Maintain high-value food stores while the grid serves industrial loads." "Submit 32 × minecraft:golden_carrot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2410000000000005.title: "Electric Heat"
	quest.2410000000000005.quest_desc: ["Use controlled electric heat and understand its impact on total load." "Submit 2 × create_new_age:heater. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2410000000000006.title: "Water Service"
	quest.2410000000000006.quest_desc: ["Provide the stored water capacity needed for farms, cooling, and public service." "Submit 16 × minecraft:water_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2410000000000007.title: "Provision Through Blackout"
	quest.2410000000000007.quest_desc: ["Retain food that survives a grid failure; electrification must not create a single point of starvation." "Submit 32 × wastelands:canned_food. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2410000000000008.title: "Electrified Provisioning Charter"
	quest.2410000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind biomass power, motors, heat, water, and resilient food into the Farming contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era4_farming_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Farming and Biological Production charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.3410000000000001.title: "Potential Difference"
	quest.3410000000000001.quest_desc: ["Carry an instrument before diagnosing an energized system." "Submit 1 × powergrid:multimeter. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3410000000000002.title: "The First Circuit"
	quest.3410000000000002.quest_desc: ["Produce Power Grid circuitry through its intended manufacturing path." "Submit 8 × powergrid:circuit_board. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3410000000000003.title: "Survey the Lightning-Rod Tower"
	quest.3410000000000003.quest_desc: ["Enter the Create Structures Overhaul lightning-rod tower and assess the route, elevation, and protection needed for a distant feeder." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3420000000000003.title: "Document a protected feeder route"
	quest.3410000000000004.title: "Lines Have Limits"
	quest.3410000000000004.quest_desc: ["Use correctly rated connection hardware for meaningful transmission." "Submit 8 × powergrid:heavy_wire_connector. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3410000000000005.title: "Step Up, Step Down"
	quest.3410000000000005.quest_desc: ["Build transformer cores and plan voltage changes where the network requires them." "Submit 4 × powergrid:transformer_core. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3410000000000006.title: "Interrupt the Fault"
	quest.3410000000000006.quest_desc: ["Install isolation hardware before calling the feeder complete." "Submit 4 × powergrid:hv_switch. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3410000000000007.title: "Portable Restoration"
	quest.3410000000000007.quest_desc: ["Prepare portable storage for diagnostics, emergency starts, and field repair." "Submit 4 × powergrid:portable_battery. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3410000000000008.title: "Grid Survey Charter"
	quest.3410000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind instruments, circuits, route records, protection, and portable power into the Exploration contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era4_exploration_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Exploration and Recovery charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.4410000000000001.title: "Generator Coil"
	quest.4410000000000001.quest_desc: ["Convert rotation into current with a deliberate generator assembly." "Submit 1 × create_new_age:generator_coil. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4410000000000002.title: "Advanced Energiser"
	quest.4410000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Energiser introduces controlled electrical processing conditions." "Submit 1 × create_new_age:advanced_energiser. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4410000000000003.title: "Overcharged Conductor"
	quest.4410000000000003.quest_desc: ["Advanced conductors are optional mastery and dangerous to treat casually." "Submit 1 × create_new_age:overcharged_iron_wire. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4410000000000004.title: "Battery Buffer"
	quest.4410000000000004.quest_desc: ["Generation and consumption rarely match moment to moment; buffer the difference." "Submit 1 × powergrid:battery. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4410000000000005.title: "Public Lighting"
	quest.4410000000000005.quest_desc: ["Light inhabited paths, farms, and emergency stations with maintained electrical service." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4420000000000005.title: "Commission maintained public lighting"
	quest.4410000000000006.title: "Critical Loads Register"
	quest.4410000000000006.quest_desc: ["Label life-safety loads separately from optional industry and record restart order." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4420000000000006.title: "Create a critical-load and restart register"
	quest.4410000000000007.title: "Circuit Design Table"
	quest.4410000000000007.quest_desc: ["Circuit design is now an explicit production discipline." "Submit 1 × powergrid:circuit_design_table. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4410000000000008.title: "Switching by Voltage"
	quest.4410000000000008.quest_desc: ["Correct switchgear prevents routine maintenance from becoming a settlement emergency." "Submit 1 × powergrid:mv_switch. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4410000000000009.title: "First ME Power Package"
	quest.4410000000000009.quest_desc: ["This optional branch prepares the boundary between the civic grid and AE2." "Submit 1 × ae2:energy_acceptor. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.5410000000000002.title: "Electrical Grid Foundation"
	quest.5410000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Electrical Foundation Core records a stable grid with generation, productive loads, and protection. I can now authorize the first proper powered ME network infrastructure." "Craft the shared core through any one professional charter to open Era 5." ]
	task.5420000000000001.title: "Review the Era 4 routes and hazards"

	quest.5510000000000001.title: "Era 5: Automated Industry"
	quest.5510000000000001.quest_desc: ["A stable grid makes unattended production possible. Era 5 joins automated extraction, renewable biosystems, recovered computation, AE2, Oritech, and cybernetic manufacturing." "Mining uses hexagons, Farming uses hearts, Exploration uses diamonds, and technical side work uses gears. Any one completed charter can finish the era. Recipes are pack-modified; use JEI for the live requirements." "Division of labor is strength only when every result can reach the people who need it." ]
	quest.6511000000000001.title: "Mining Level 5: Titanium"
	quest.6511000000000001.quest_desc: ["The electrum pickaxe can harvest titanium ore. Refine the ore, form titanium handles, and craft the titanium pickaxe. Mining Level 5 opens uranium, thorium, radium, neptunium, and the other Era 6 radioactive deposits." "Obtain 1 × more_ores_more_gems:titanium_pickaxe. This shared gateway is required before the three profession routes divide; inspect the live pack recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.1510000000000001.title: "Beyond Mechanical Contact"
	quest.1510000000000001.quest_desc: ["Build an Oritech pulverizer and compare its yield and energy needs with earlier processing." "Submit 1 × oritech:pulverizer_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1510000000000002.title: "Machine Core Anatomy"
	quest.1510000000000002.quest_desc: ["Begin the Oritech core ladder with repeatable components, not a single loot find." "Submit 8 × oritech:machine_core_1. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1510000000000003.title: "Separate the Fraction"
	quest.1510000000000003.quest_desc: ["Use a centrifuge where mixed material must become controlled outputs." "Submit 1 × oritech:centrifuge_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1510000000000004.title: "Assembly Under Power"
	quest.1510000000000004.quest_desc: ["Automate machine assembly behind item, fluid, and energy buffers." "Submit 1 × oritech:assembler_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1510000000000005.title: "Core Escalation"
	quest.1510000000000005.quest_desc: ["Advance the core ladder only after lower machines are sustainable." "Submit 4 × oritech:machine_core_3. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1510000000000006.title: "Laser Extraction"
	quest.1510000000000006.quest_desc: ["Deploy laser hardware for high-tier extraction or processing." "Submit 2 × oritech:laser_arm_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1510000000000007.title: "Factory Acceptance Order"
	quest.1510000000000007.quest_desc: ["Produce advanced cores in a batch large enough to prove the factory is repeatable." "Submit 8 × oritech:machine_core_4. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1510000000000008.title: "Automated Extraction Charter"
	quest.1510000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind Oritech processing, core manufacture, separation, and laser extraction into the Mining contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era5_mining_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Mining and Extraction charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.2510000000000001.title: "Fields on a Schedule"
	quest.2510000000000001.quest_desc: ["Build enough harvesters for multiple renewable production lines." "Submit 8 × create:mechanical_harvester. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2510000000000002.title: "Mechanical Cultivation"
	quest.2510000000000002.quest_desc: ["Automate soil preparation without allowing a contraption to destroy neighboring infrastructure." "Submit 8 × create:mechanical_plough. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2510000000000003.title: "Biomass Generator Bank"
	quest.2510000000000003.quest_desc: ["Convert biological surplus into buffered factory energy." "Submit 4 × oritech:bio_generator_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2510000000000004.title: "Automated Kitchen Inputs"
	quest.2510000000000004.quest_desc: ["Automate prepared ingredients before attempting complete meals." "Submit 64 × farmersdelight:wheat_dough. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2510000000000005.title: "Livestock Without Neglect"
	quest.2510000000000005.quest_desc: ["Automate collection while preserving breeding stock, space, and server-safe entity limits." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." "This is step 5 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	task.2520000000000005.title: "Commission a server-safe livestock system"
	quest.2510000000000006.title: "The Food Vault"
	quest.2510000000000006.quest_desc: ["Provide upgraded storage for bulk biological inputs and finished food." "Submit 4 × sophisticatedstorage:stack_upgrade_tier_2. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2510000000000007.title: "A Week Without Hands"
	quest.2510000000000007.quest_desc: ["Deliver a large renewable food order from the automated system." "Submit 256 × minecraft:bread. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2510000000000008.title: "Automated Biosystems Charter"
	quest.2510000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind cultivation, harvest, biomass power, storage, and provisioning into the Farming contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era5_farming_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Farming and Biological Production charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.3510000000000001.title: "Certus Evidence"
	quest.3510000000000001.quest_desc: ["Recover and prepare certus material without treating my earlier sample as a network." "Submit 32 × ae2:certus_quartz_crystal. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3510000000000002.title: "Rebuild the Inscriber"
	quest.3510000000000002.quest_desc: ["Complete the cross-mod Inscriber reconstruction recipe." "Submit 1 × ae2:inscriber. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3510000000000003.title: "Presses of Lost Knowledge"
	quest.3510000000000003.quest_desc: ["Acquire the engineering press and inspect the full processor sequence." "Submit 1 × ae2:engineering_processor_press. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3510000000000004.title: "Three Kinds of Thought"
	quest.3510000000000004.quest_desc: ["Begin processor production; calculation and engineering processors are equally necessary." "Submit 8 × ae2:logic_processor. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3510000000000005.title: "A Network With Memory"
	quest.3510000000000005.quest_desc: ["Expand the earlier storage reward into a maintained local ME system." "Submit 4 × ae2:item_storage_cell_1k. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3510000000000006.title: "Surgery Knowledge Recovered"
	quest.3510000000000006.quest_desc: ["Recover or build the institution that makes cyberware safer than scavenged self-surgery." "Submit 1 × createcybernetics:surgery_table. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3510000000000007.title: "Engineering Intelligence"
	quest.3510000000000007.quest_desc: ["Produce advanced processors in settlement quantities." "Submit 16 × ae2:engineering_processor. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3510000000000008.title: "Recovery Intelligence Charter"
	quest.3510000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind certus, processors, digital storage, and recovered surgical knowledge into the Exploration contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era5_exploration_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Exploration and Recovery charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.4510000000000001.title: "Machine Upgrade Discipline"
	quest.4510000000000001.quest_desc: ["Apply upgrades to measured bottlenecks rather than every available slot." "Submit 1 × oritech:machine_efficiency_addon. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000002.title: "Factory Buffer"
	quest.4510000000000002.quest_desc: ["Advanced machines need input and output buffers sized for interruption." "Submit 1 × oritech:large_storage_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000003.title: "Core Tier Five"
	quest.4510000000000003.quest_desc: ["Tier-five cores are optional mastery and preparation for high-energy industry." "Submit 1 × oritech:machine_core_5. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000004.title: "Local Autocrafting"
	quest.4510000000000004.quest_desc: ["Use AE2 autocrafting for local production; remote freight remains a logistics problem." "Submit 1 × ae2:molecular_assembler. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000005.title: "Pattern Provider"
	quest.4510000000000005.quest_desc: ["Patterns are authority over machines. Keep recipes intentional and auditable." "Submit 1 × ae2:pattern_provider. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000006.title: "Crafting Terminal"
	quest.4510000000000006.quest_desc: ["The coveted crafting terminal is earned after the settlement can sustain its network." "Submit 1 × ae2:crafting_terminal. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000007.title: "Diagnose Before Cutting"
	quest.4510000000000007.quest_desc: ["Scan first. Cyberware is a medical system, not an armor slot." "Submit 1 × cyber_ware_port:scanner. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000008.title: "Titanium Interface"
	quest.4510000000000008.quest_desc: ["Titanium components connect heavy industry to safe implant construction." "Submit 1 × cyber_ware_port:component_titanium. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4510000000000009.title: "Specialist Eyes"
	quest.4510000000000009.quest_desc: ["Cyberware rewards specialization; the team does not need identical bodies." "Submit 1 × createcybernetics:basecyberware_cybereyes. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.5510000000000002.title: "Automated Industry Foundation"
	quest.5510000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Automation Foundation Core proves that the settlement can schedule materials, food, information, and specialist bodies through repeatable systems. Controlled autocrafting is now authorized." "Craft the shared core through any one professional charter to open Era 6." ]
	task.5520000000000001.title: "Review the Era 5 routes and hazards"

	quest.5610000000000001.title: "Era 6: High Energy and Nuclear Engineering"
	quest.5610000000000001.quest_desc: ["Automation can now handle processes too dangerous for casual labor. Era 6 demands accountable uranium, protected food and medicine, exclusion-zone surveys, containment, cooling, and high-energy regulation." "Mining uses hexagons, Farming uses hearts, Exploration uses diamonds, and technical side work uses gears. Any one completed charter can finish the era. Recipes are pack-modified; use JEI for the live requirements." "Division of labor is strength only when every result can reach the people who need it." ]
	quest.6611000000000001.title: "Mining Level 6: Uranium"
	quest.6611000000000001.quest_desc: ["The titanium-tier pick can harvest both tungsten and uranium. The pack combines a uranium head with tungsten handles so the tool requires established Era 5 metallurgy. Mining Level 6 is the tool used for the first Era 7 and lunar ores." "Obtain 1 × more_ores_more_gems:uranium_pickaxe. This shared gateway is required before the three profession routes divide; inspect the live pack recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.1610000000000001.title: "Mineral, Not Metal"
	quest.1610000000000001.quest_desc: ["Recover controlled uranium-bearing traces; mined ore is not usable fuel." "Submit 18 × kubejs:uranium_mineral_trace. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1610000000000002.title: "Mechanical Concentration"
	quest.1610000000000002.quest_desc: ["Build a crushing line that concentrates the trace feed without creating a direct metal shortcut." "Submit 18 × kubejs:uranium_bearing_fines. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1610000000000003.title: "Wash the Feed"
	quest.1610000000000003.quest_desc: ["Separate the useful mineral fraction with water before chemical extraction." "Submit 18 × kubejs:washed_uranium_concentrate. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1610000000000004.title: "Fictionalized Extraction"
	quest.1610000000000004.quest_desc: ["Use renewable chelating broth to separate a qualified nuclear compound and contained tailings." "Submit 8 × kubejs:purified_uranium_compound. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1610000000000005.title: "Press the Green Pellet"
	quest.1610000000000005.quest_desc: ["Bind and press fuel-grade powder into pellets that are still unfit for service." "Submit 8 × kubejs:green_fuel_pellet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1610000000000006.title: "Fire and Inspect"
	quest.1610000000000006.quest_desc: ["Fire the green pellets into stable components and keep the process automated." "Submit 8 × kubejs:fired_fuel_pellet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1610000000000007.title: "A Complete Fuel Campaign"
	quest.1610000000000007.quest_desc: ["Stack, clad, cap, press, and seal a campaign-scale batch of standard reactor rods." "Submit 8 × createnuclear:uranium_rod. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1610000000000008.title: "Fuel-Cycle Charter"
	quest.1610000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind trace recovery, organic extraction, pellet manufacture, cladding, graphite, and residue control into the Mining contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era6_mining_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Mining and Extraction charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.2610000000000001.title: "Protected Agriculture"
	quest.2610000000000001.quest_desc: ["Establish a food-growing area outside the exclusion zone with isolated water and soil." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." "This is step 1 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	task.2620000000000001.title: "Commission protected agriculture"
	quest.2610000000000002.title: "Radiation Workwear"
	quest.2610000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create Nuclear provides reactor fuel processing, radiation protection, containment, and accountable atomic power." "Equip a crew with anti-radiation head protection; a single suit is not a safety program." "Submit 4 × createnuclear:black_anti_radiation_helmet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2610000000000003.title: "Clean Water Reserve"
	quest.2610000000000003.quest_desc: ["Reserve protected potable water for workers and incident response." "Submit 64 × wastelands:purified_water. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2610000000000004.title: "Medical Nutrition"
	quest.2610000000000004.quest_desc: ["Stock high-value emergency nutrition without calling it a cure for exposure." "Submit 16 × minecraft:golden_apple. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2610000000000005.title: "Decontamination Station"
	quest.2610000000000005.quest_desc: ["Build a marked clean/dirty boundary with replacement clothing and sealed storage." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." "This is step 5 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	task.2620000000000005.title: "Commission a decontamination station"
	quest.2610000000000006.title: "Resilient Food Stores"
	quest.2610000000000006.quest_desc: ["Keep sealed food independent of exposed farms and grid interruptions." "Submit 64 × wastelands:canned_food. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2610000000000007.title: "Thirty-Day Habitat Reserve"
	quest.2610000000000007.quest_desc: ["Provide a long-duration reserve for a contained work crew." "Submit 128 × minecraft:golden_carrot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2610000000000008.title: "Radiological Life-Support Charter"
	quest.2610000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind protected agriculture, water, food, equipment, and decontamination into the Farming contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era6_farming_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Farming and Biological Production charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.3610000000000001.title: "Map the Exclusion Zone"
	quest.3610000000000001.quest_desc: ["Carry recovery navigation before entering terrain that punishes disorientation." "Submit 1 × minecraft:recovery_compass. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3610000000000002.title: "Reactor Plans"
	quest.3610000000000002.quest_desc: ["Recover or create the blueprint before placing a core." "Submit 1 × createnuclear:reactor_blueprint_item. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3610000000000003.title: "Containment Before Criticality"
	quest.3610000000000003.quest_desc: ["Build the physical boundary before installing fuel." "Submit 32 × createnuclear:reactor_casing. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3610000000000004.title: "Heat Must Leave"
	quest.3610000000000004.quest_desc: ["Provide redundant cooling capacity and accessible service routes." "Submit 8 × createnuclear:reactor_cooler. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3610000000000005.title: "Instrument the Core"
	quest.3610000000000005.quest_desc: ["Centralize control and define the shutdown condition before startup." "Submit 1 × createnuclear:reactor_controller. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3610000000000006.title: "Enter the Exclusion Laboratory"
	quest.3610000000000006.quest_desc: ["Enter the buried Spore laboratory as the field target for this exclusion-zone survey." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3620000000000006.title: "Complete and record a limited criticality test"
	quest.3610000000000007.title: "Return From the Zone"
	quest.3610000000000007.quest_desc: ["Detonate AE2 Lightning Tech Overload TNT in a controlled exclusion zone and recover the initialized Mysterious Cell produced above the blast." "Detonate AE2 Lightning Tech Overload TNT under controlled conditions, then recover and submit the Mysterious Cell it creates." "This is step 7 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3610000000000008.title: "Exclusion Survey Charter"
	quest.3610000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind navigation, blueprints, containment, cooling, and controlled research into the Exploration contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era6_exploration_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Exploration and Recovery charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.4610000000000001.title: "Cladding Shop"
	quest.4610000000000001.quest_desc: ["Press standardized steel cladding independently from the radioactive pellet line." "Submit 1 × kubejs:empty_fuel_cladding. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4610000000000002.title: "Pellet Charges"
	quest.4610000000000002.quest_desc: ["Accumulate inspected pellet stacks before the visible sequenced-assembly line." "Submit 1 × kubejs:fuel_pellet_stack. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4610000000000003.title: "Nuclear Graphite"
	quest.4610000000000003.quest_desc: ["Refine, bind, bake, purify, machine, and frame carbon as reactor-grade graphite." "Submit 1 × createnuclear:graphite_rod. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4610000000000004.title: "Full Protective Set"
	quest.4610000000000004.quest_desc: ["Partial protection is a temporary measure; build full equipment before routine operations." "Submit 1 × createnuclear:black_anti_radiation_chestplate. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4610000000000005.title: "Radiation-Protected Storage"
	quest.4610000000000005.quest_desc: ["Research storage protection without assuming it replaces physical containment." "Submit 1 × ae2lt:module_radiation_protection. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4610000000000006.title: "Emergency Drill"
	quest.4610000000000006.quest_desc: ["Practice alarm, scram, evacuation, accountability, and reentry authority." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4620000000000006.title: "Complete a reactor emergency drill"
	quest.4610000000000007.title: "Oritech Reactor Control"
	quest.4610000000000007.quest_desc: ["Compare reactor systems instead of mixing parts across incompatible designs." "Submit 1 × oritech:reactor_controller. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4610000000000008.title: "High-Capacity Battery"
	quest.4610000000000008.quest_desc: ["Buffer high-energy loads so factory transients do not destabilize the reactor." "Submit 1 × oritech:advanced_battery. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4610000000000009.title: "Lightning Cell Research"
	quest.4610000000000009.quest_desc: ["This is an AE2LT precursor, not permission to skip the remaining storage ladder." "Submit 1 × ae2lt:lightning_cell_component_i. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.5610000000000002.title: "High Energy and Nuclear Engineering Foundation"
	quest.5610000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Atomic Foundation Core proves that power no longer depends on pretending consequences disappear. Fuel, people, land, and waste have all been included in the accounting." "Craft the shared core through any one professional charter to open Era 7." ]
	task.5620000000000001.title: "Review the Era 6 routes and hazards"

	quest.5710000000000001.title: "Era 7: Orbital Industry"
	quest.5710000000000001.quest_desc: ["Atomic power makes leaving the atmosphere plausible, not safe. Era 7 separates extraterrestrial materials, closed-loop habitation, and expedition logistics before combining them into orbital industry." "Mining uses hexagons, Farming uses hearts, Exploration uses diamonds, and technical side work uses gears. Any one completed charter can finish the era. Recipes are pack-modified; use JEI for the live requirements." "Division of labor is strength only when every result can reach the people who need it." ]
	quest.1710000000000001.title: "Prospect the Moon"
	quest.1710000000000001.quest_desc: ["Use the Era 6 uranium pick to recover the Moon's distinct industrial feedstock. Reaching the deposit still requires the shared launch, oxygen, and return infrastructure taught by the parallel orbital routes." "Submit 32 × stellaris:moon_desh_ore. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1710000000000002.title: "Raw Desh"
	quest.1710000000000002.quest_desc: ["Prepare extraterrestrial ore through its own processing law." "Submit 32 × stellaris:raw_desh_ingot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1710000000000003.title: "Desh Refinement"
	quest.1710000000000003.quest_desc: ["Produce refined desh without importing every intermediate from Earth." "Submit 32 × stellaris:desh_ingot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1710000000000004.title: "Forge the Orbital Pick"
	quest.1710000000000004.quest_desc: ["Use refined desh as the required handle material for an Era 7 pick. Adamantite is first recovered with the Era 6 uranium pick; the completed tool is the final ore-mining level in the current map." "Submit 1 × more_ores_more_gems:adamantite_pickaxe. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1710000000000005.title: "Mars Assay"
	quest.1710000000000005.quest_desc: ["Use the new Era 7 pick while expanding prospecting to a second planetary material family." "Submit 32 × stellaris:mars_ostrum_ore. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1710000000000006.title: "Structural Desh"
	quest.1710000000000006.quest_desc: ["Accumulate space-derived structural material at construction scale inside a powered, survivable worksite." "Submit 16 × stellaris:desh_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1710000000000007.title: "Interworld Material Order"
	quest.1710000000000007.quest_desc: ["Deliver a major extraterrestrial material batch for orbital construction." "Submit 128 × stellaris:desh_ingot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1710000000000008.title: "Extraterrestrial Materials Charter"
	quest.1710000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind lunar prospecting, desh refining, Mars surveying, and protected processing into the Mining contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era7_mining_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Mining and Extraction charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.2710000000000001.title: "Air in a Tank"
	quest.2710000000000001.quest_desc: ["Produce and fill personal oxygen capacity before leaving a protected habitat." "Submit 8 × stellaris:oxygen_tank. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2710000000000002.title: "Distribute the Atmosphere"
	quest.2710000000000002.quest_desc: ["Build habitat oxygen distribution with monitored reserves." "Submit 2 × stellaris:oxygen_distributor. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2710000000000003.title: "A Suit Is a Vehicle"
	quest.2710000000000003.quest_desc: ["Begin a complete pressure and environmental protection system." "Submit 1 × stellaris:space_suit_helmet. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2710000000000004.title: "Complete Suit Check"
	quest.2710000000000004.quest_desc: ["Verify the complete suit, tanks, and emergency return plan before excursion." "Submit 1 × stellaris:space_suit_chestplate. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2710000000000005.title: "Food Beyond Soil"
	quest.2710000000000005.quest_desc: ["Prepare compact food and a renewable off-world production plan." "Submit 64 × minecraft:golden_carrot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2710000000000006.title: "Water Is a Closed Loop"
	quest.2710000000000006.quest_desc: ["Move enough water to establish recovery and redundancy rather than disposable consumption." "Submit 32 × minecraft:water_bucket. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2710000000000007.title: "Thirty-Day Habitat"
	quest.2710000000000007.quest_desc: ["Provide long-duration atmosphere reserves for a working habitat." "Submit 8 × stellaris:big_oxygen_tank. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2710000000000008.title: "Closed-Loop Habitat Charter"
	quest.2710000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind oxygen, suits, food, water, and habitat endurance into the Farming contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era7_farming_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Farming and Biological Production charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.3710000000000001.title: "Mass Must Leave the Ground"
	quest.3710000000000001.quest_desc: ["Build a launch area with room for assembly, exclusion, and recovery." "Submit 16 × stellaris:rocket_launch_pad. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 1 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3710000000000002.title: "Engines Before Rockets"
	quest.3710000000000002.quest_desc: ["Manufacture propulsion hardware before assembling a crewed vehicle." "Submit 4 × stellaris:rocket_engine. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3710000000000003.title: "Guided Shape"
	quest.3710000000000003.quest_desc: ["Complete guidance and protected vehicle structure." "Submit 2 × stellaris:rocket_nose_cone. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3710000000000004.title: "Flight Hardware"
	quest.3710000000000004.quest_desc: ["Produce a full set of control surfaces and spares." "Submit 8 × stellaris:rocket_fin. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3710000000000005.title: "Reach the Moon"
	quest.3710000000000005.quest_desc: ["Enter the Stellaris Moon dimension. Arrival is detected automatically and replaces the former self-certified flight-test checkmark." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3720000000000005.title: "Complete an uncrewed flight test"
	quest.3710000000000006.title: "Find the First Landing"
	quest.3710000000000006.quest_desc: ["Enter the registered Stellaris first-landing structure on the Moon and establish a safe retreat point." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3720000000000006.title: "Document a safe extraterrestrial landing"
	quest.3710000000000007.title: "Science Returned Alive"
	quest.3710000000000007.quest_desc: ["Return a planetary sample to the settlement rather than merely reaching it." "Submit 32 × stellaris:mars_ice_shard_ore. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3710000000000008.title: "Flight Expedition Charter"
	quest.3710000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind launch infrastructure, propulsion, navigation, landing, and returned science into the Exploration contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era7_exploration_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Exploration and Recovery charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.4710000000000001.title: "Solar Field"
	quest.4710000000000001.quest_desc: ["Off-world industry needs a power source that survives after the landing craft leaves." "Submit 1 × stellaris:solar_panel. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4710000000000002.title: "Desh Plating"
	quest.4710000000000002.quest_desc: ["Turn local material into protected structures instead of shipping every wall from Earth." "Submit 1 × stellaris:desh_plating_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4710000000000003.title: "Venus Prospect"
	quest.4710000000000003.quest_desc: ["A third-world sample is optional mastery and evidence of a genuinely interplanetary industry." "Submit 1 × stellaris:venus_corronium_ore. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4710000000000004.title: "Jet Suit Research"
	quest.4710000000000004.quest_desc: ["Mobility equipment is a reward for established life support, never its replacement." "Submit 1 × stellaris:jet_suit_chestplate. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4710000000000005.title: "Habitat Register"
	quest.4710000000000005.quest_desc: ["Record atmosphere, power, food, water, occupancy, and emergency duration." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4720000000000005.title: "Complete the habitat life-support register"
	quest.4710000000000006.title: "Frontier Farm"
	quest.4710000000000006.quest_desc: ["Produce one renewable crop cycle away from Earth and return its records." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4720000000000006.title: "Complete an off-world crop cycle"
	quest.4710000000000007.title: "Rocket Station"
	quest.4710000000000007.quest_desc: ["A station turns one launch into repeatable infrastructure." "Submit 1 × stellaris:rocket_station. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4710000000000008.title: "Cargo Upgrade"
	quest.4710000000000008.quest_desc: ["Cargo capacity matters only when logistics can supply and unload it." "Submit 1 × stellaris:big_rocket_upgrade. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4710000000000009.title: "Global Logistics Handoff"
	quest.4710000000000009.quest_desc: ["Register an interplanetary cargo route in the Global Logistics chapter." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4720000000000009.title: "Register the orbital cargo handoff"
	quest.5710000000000002.title: "Orbital Industry Foundation"
	quest.5710000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Orbital Foundation Core proves that civilization can leave Earth, live elsewhere, manufacture from local materials, and return knowledge rather than corpses." "Craft the shared core through any one professional charter to open Era 8." ]
	task.5720000000000001.title: "Review the Era 7 routes and hazards"

	quest.5810000000000001.title: "Era 8: Infinite Domain"
	quest.5810000000000001.quest_desc: ["The final era is not a single machine. It is proof that materials, living systems, information, and transport can survive beyond any one settlement or specialist. Mining Level 7 is the present ore ceiling: Era 8 equipment is capstone specialization, not permission to skip an additional hidden ore tier." "Mining uses hexagons, Farming uses hearts, Exploration uses diamonds, and technical side work uses gears. Any one completed charter can finish the era. Recipes are pack-modified; use JEI for the live requirements." "Division of labor is strength only when every result can reach the people who need it." ]
	quest.1810000000000001.title: "Choose the Great Work"
	quest.1810000000000001.quest_desc: ["Select and document a civilization-scale construction objective." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." "This is step 1 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	task.1820000000000001.title: "Declare the civilization megaproject"
	quest.1810000000000002.title: "Foundations Beyond a Factory"
	quest.1810000000000002.quest_desc: ["Submit compressed masonry representing millions of ordinary blocks." "Submit 8 × allthecompressed:cobblestone_5x. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1810000000000003.title: "Metals of Every Era"
	quest.1810000000000003.quest_desc: ["Deliver steel alongside the advanced materials that superseded it." "Submit 64 × tfmg:steel_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1810000000000004.title: "Conductors for a Domain"
	quest.1810000000000004.quest_desc: ["Supply conductor stock for a network larger than one factory floor." "Submit 128 × minecraft:copper_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1810000000000005.title: "Material From Another World"
	quest.1810000000000005.quest_desc: ["Make extraterrestrial material part of routine construction." "Submit 32 × stellaris:desh_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1810000000000006.title: "Highest Machine Core"
	quest.1810000000000006.quest_desc: ["Produce the final Oritech core tier as maintained industry, not a trophy." "Submit 8 × oritech:machine_core_7. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1810000000000007.title: "Dedicate the Great Work"
	quest.1810000000000007.quest_desc: ["Consume a final ultra-tier material contribution in the completed project." "Submit 32 × minecraft:netherite_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 7 of the Mining and Extraction route." ]
	quest.1810000000000008.title: "Megaproject Materials Charter"
	quest.1810000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind compressed foundations, metals, conductors, space materials, and machine cores into the Mining contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era8_mining_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Mining and Extraction charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.2810000000000001.title: "A Biosphere Is Infrastructure"
	quest.2810000000000001.quest_desc: ["Design a living system with soil, water, food, habitat, and recovery capacity." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." "This is step 1 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	task.2820000000000001.title: "Document the civilization biosphere plan"
	quest.2810000000000002.title: "Seed Archive"
	quest.2810000000000002.quest_desc: ["Preserve enough basic seed stock for recovery after regional crop failure." "Submit 256 × minecraft:wheat_seeds. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2810000000000003.title: "Food for a City"
	quest.2810000000000003.quest_desc: ["Deliver concentrated food reserves without consuming breeding or planting stock." "Submit 256 × minecraft:golden_carrot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2810000000000004.title: "Water for a Frontier"
	quest.2810000000000004.quest_desc: ["Provide clean water for both Earth settlements and remote habitats." "Submit 128 × wastelands:purified_water. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2810000000000005.title: "Atmosphere Reserve"
	quest.2810000000000005.quest_desc: ["Maintain enough oxygen capacity to survive delayed interplanetary resupply." "Submit 32 × stellaris:big_oxygen_tank. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 5 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2810000000000006.title: "Renewable Energy Reserve"
	quest.2810000000000006.quest_desc: ["Preserve a restartable biological energy path beside atomic and orbital grids." "Submit 16 × oritech:bio_generator_block. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	quest.2810000000000007.title: "Restore a Dead Place"
	quest.2810000000000007.quest_desc: ["Turn a damaged site into maintained living habitat and record how it stays alive." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." "This is step 7 of the Farming and Biological Production route." ]
	task.2820000000000007.title: "Complete and document a habitat restoration"
	quest.2810000000000008.title: "Biosphere Stewardship Charter"
	quest.2810000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind seeds, food, water, atmosphere, renewable energy, and restoration into the Farming contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era8_farming_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Farming and Biological Production charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.3810000000000001.title: "Register the Lunar Hub"
	quest.3810000000000001.quest_desc: ["Enter a Stellaris Moon space base as the first verified hub in the final exploration route." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3820000000000001.title: "Register the civilization hubs"
	quest.3810000000000002.title: "The Archive of What Was Lost"
	quest.3810000000000002.quest_desc: ["Preserve essential patterns and records in protected digital storage." "Submit 4 × ae2:item_storage_cell_256k. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 2 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3810000000000003.title: "Quantum Link"
	quest.3810000000000003.quest_desc: ["Establish high-tier network infrastructure without pretending it moves physical freight for free." "Submit 2 × ae2:quantum_link. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 3 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3810000000000004.title: "Wireless Stewardship"
	quest.3810000000000004.quest_desc: ["Provide controlled high-tier access to responsible specialists." "Submit 4 × ae2:wireless_crafting_terminal. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 4 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3810000000000005.title: "Cargo Beyond the Sky"
	quest.3810000000000005.quest_desc: ["Enter a Mercury mining ship and assess its cargo interfaces, hazards, and return route." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3820000000000005.title: "Complete an interplanetary cargo contract"
	quest.3810000000000006.title: "Return What Earth Lacks"
	quest.3810000000000006.quest_desc: ["Deliver a strategic extraterrestrial material shipment home." "Submit 256 × stellaris:desh_ingot. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This is step 6 of the Exploration and Recovery route." ]
	quest.3810000000000007.title: "The Venus Domain Contract"
	quest.3810000000000007.quest_desc: ["Enter a Venus outpost as the final registered destination in the multi-world Domain route." "This is a registry-backed objective; no manual checkmark is required."]
	task.3820000000000007.title: "Complete the multi-origin Domain contract"
	quest.3810000000000008.title: "Domain Network Charter"
	quest.3810000000000008.quest_desc: ["Bind archives, quantum infrastructure, interplanetary freight, and multi-settlement coordination into the Exploration contribution." "Submit 1 × kubejs:era8_exploration_contribution. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." "This Exploration and Recovery charter is one valid route to the era capstone; the other professions remain worthwhile." ]
	quest.4810000000000001.title: "Maintainable Construction"
	quest.4810000000000001.quest_desc: ["Provide replacement parts and service access for the megaproject." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4820000000000001.title: "Audit megaproject maintenance access"
	quest.4810000000000002.title: "Energy at Monument Scale"
	quest.4810000000000002.quest_desc: ["Store energy without making one battery the sole point of failure." "Submit 1 × ae2:dense_energy_cell. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4810000000000003.title: "Accelerator Mastery"
	quest.4810000000000003.quest_desc: ["Complete the highest-energy industrial research still useful to the civilization." "Submit 1 × oritech:accelerator_controller. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4810000000000004.title: "Redundant Memory"
	quest.4810000000000004.quest_desc: ["Maintain duplicate archives in separated, powered locations." "Submit 1 × ae2:drive. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4810000000000005.title: "Final Cybernetic Choice"
	quest.4810000000000005.quest_desc: ["The strongest implants remain personal specialist choices, not mandatory uniforms." "Submit 1 × createcybernetics:netherite_qpu. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4810000000000006.title: "Infinite Storage Research"
	quest.4810000000000006.quest_desc: ["At the end of progression, infinite storage becomes a reward rather than a bypass." "Complete the Infinite Domain capstone, claim its Infinite Storage Cell reward, then let the terminal verify that you are carrying it." ]
	quest.4810000000000007.title: "Quantum Ring"
	quest.4810000000000007.quest_desc: ["Quantum network hardware belongs to governed infrastructure." "Submit 1 × ae2:quantum_ring. Use JEI for the live pack recipe." ]
	quest.4810000000000008.title: "Interplanetary Resilience"
	quest.4810000000000008.quest_desc: ["Demonstrate an alternate route when the primary cargo connection is unavailable." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4820000000000008.title: "Complete an alternate-route logistics test"
	quest.4810000000000009.title: "Civilization Succession"
	quest.4810000000000009.quest_desc: ["Write instructions that let a new team operate the domain without its founders." "Complete and document this team task, then use the checkmark." ]
	task.4820000000000009.title: "Complete the civilization succession record"
	quest.5810000000000002.title: "Infinite Domain"
	quest.5810000000000002.quest_desc: ["The Infinite Domain Core records a civilization capable of preserving knowledge, maintaining life, building across worlds, and recovering from the loss of any single facility. I have no higher gate to place before you." "The main progression is complete, but every unfinished profession, logistics route, AE2 system, cyberware specialization, settlement, and restoration project remains available." ]
	task.5820000000000001.title: "Review the Era 8 routes and hazards"

	quest.7011000000000001.title: "Carbon Before Chemistry"
	quest.7011000000000001.quest_desc: ["Charcoal is renewable stored carbon. Primitive refining consumes it directly and loses most of the useful mineral, but it establishes the link between managed biomass and metallurgy." "Obtain 8 charcoal. This optional ribbon teaches the recovery baseline without delaying the main survival route." ]
	quest.7011000000000002.title: "What the Rock Actually Contains"
	quest.7011000000000002.quest_desc: ["Ore now yields mineral traces rather than finished metal. Deepslate yields an additive three or four extra traces; Fortune affects extraction only, never later processing." "Collect 9 copper mineral traces, the primitive one-ingot recovery budget." ]
	quest.7011000000000003.title: "Crude Mineral Preparation"
	quest.7011000000000003.quest_desc: ["Manual preparation turns recognizable fragments into mineral dust. This is intentionally laborious and only preserves one nugget-equivalent per trace." "Prepare 9 copper mineral dust. Era 1 machinery will replace this hand step." ]
	quest.7011000000000004.title: "Nine Traces, One Ingot"
	quest.7011000000000004.quest_desc: ["Refine the dust into nine nuggets and consolidate them. Primitive recovery is the 100% reference against which every later plant is balanced." "Obtain 9 copper nuggets. The charcoal reward supports another small refining batch rather than replacing the factory." ]
	quest.7111000000000001.title: "A Renewable Metallurgical Feedstock"
	quest.7111000000000001.quest_desc: ["minecraft:wheat supplies renewable organic material for mechanical washing. This is an industrial crop input, not an arbitrary bonus ingredient." "Obtain 8 units after reaching the era's Farming milestone." ]
	quest.7111000000000002.title: "Extract the Active Fraction"
	quest.7111000000000002.quest_desc: ["Use the era's unlocked machinery to turn the feedstock into Fibrous Biomass. Physical preparation exposes the useful fraction before any mineral is added." "Produce 4 units and inspect the complete Create recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.7111000000000003.title: "Mechanical Washing"
	quest.7111000000000003.quest_desc: ["Basin mixing turns fibrous biomass into Alkaline Botanical Wash. Each later solution incorporates the prior tier's chemistry, creating an actual technology chain. This early tier consumes its reagent completely." "Produce one bucket. The pipe reward helps move the solution without making buckets the intended factory interface." ]
	quest.7111000000000004.title: "Prepare the Copper Feed"
	quest.7111000000000004.quest_desc: ["Mining supplies copper mineral; machinery liberates and prepares it for selective treatment." "Prepare one deterministic nine-unit batch. Extraction bonuses have already happened at the ore block and cannot multiply this stage." ]
	quest.7111000000000005.title: "Separate the Valuable Fraction"
	quest.7111000000000005.quest_desc: ["Alkaline Botanical Wash changes how the mineral separates. The resulting washed material represents 10 recoverable nugget-equivalents from nine original traces." "Make the full deterministic batch; principal-metal yield never depends on hidden chance rolls." ]
	quest.7111000000000006.title: "Industrialize Mechanical Washing"
	quest.7111000000000006.quest_desc: ["Recover 10 copper nuggets and route the solids, fluids, and heat as a repeatable line. This is 111% of primitive recovery." "The filter reward supports routing; it does not replace the processed metal or the refinery." ]
	quest.7211000000000001.title: "A Renewable Metallurgical Feedstock"
	quest.7211000000000001.quest_desc: ["minecraft:oak_log supplies renewable organic material for tannic conditioning. This is an industrial crop input, not an arbitrary bonus ingredient." "Obtain 8 units after reaching the era's Farming milestone." ]
	quest.7211000000000002.title: "Extract the Active Fraction"
	quest.7211000000000002.quest_desc: ["Use the era's unlocked machinery to turn the feedstock into Tannic Pulp. Physical preparation exposes the useful fraction before any mineral is added." "Produce 4 units and inspect the complete Create recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.7211000000000003.title: "Tannic Conditioning"
	quest.7211000000000003.quest_desc: ["Basin mixing turns tannic pulp into Tannic Extract. Each later solution incorporates the prior tier's chemistry, creating an actual technology chain. This early tier consumes its reagent completely." "Produce one bucket. The pipe reward helps move the solution without making buckets the intended factory interface." ]
	quest.7211000000000004.title: "Prepare the Iron Feed"
	quest.7211000000000004.quest_desc: ["Mining supplies iron mineral; machinery liberates and prepares it for selective treatment. It also requires the preceding processing ribbon, so the chemistry develops cumulatively rather than appearing from nowhere." "Prepare one deterministic nine-unit batch. Extraction bonuses have already happened at the ore block and cannot multiply this stage." ]
	quest.7211000000000005.title: "Separate the Valuable Fraction"
	quest.7211000000000005.quest_desc: ["Tannic Extract changes how the mineral separates. The resulting conditioned material represents 11 recoverable nugget-equivalents from nine original traces." "Make the full deterministic batch; principal-metal yield never depends on hidden chance rolls." ]
	quest.7211000000000006.title: "Industrialize Tannic Conditioning"
	quest.7211000000000006.quest_desc: ["Recover 11 iron nuggets and route the solids, fluids, and heat as a repeatable line. This is 122% of primitive recovery." "The filter reward supports routing; it does not replace the processed metal or the refinery." ]
	quest.7311000000000001.title: "A Renewable Metallurgical Feedstock"
	quest.7311000000000001.quest_desc: ["minecraft:sugar supplies renewable organic material for fermented leaching. This is an industrial crop input, not an arbitrary bonus ingredient." "Obtain 8 units after reaching the era's Farming milestone." ]
	quest.7311000000000002.title: "Extract the Active Fraction"
	quest.7311000000000002.quest_desc: ["Use the era's unlocked machinery to turn the feedstock into Fermented Mash. Physical preparation exposes the useful fraction before any mineral is added." "Produce 4 units and inspect the complete Create recipe in JEI." ]
	quest.7311000000000003.title: "Fermented Leaching"
	quest.7311000000000003.quest_desc: ["Basin mixing turns fermented mash into Fermented Acid Wash. Each later solution incorporates the prior tier's chemistry, creating an actual technology chain. This early tier consumes its reagent completely." "Produce one bucket. The pipe reward helps move the solution without making buckets the intended factory interface." ]
	quest.7311000000000004.title: "Prepare the Nickel Feed"
	quest.7311000000000004.quest_desc: ["Mining supplies nickel mineral; machinery liberates and prepares it for selective treatment. It also requires the preceding processing ribbon, so the chemistry develops cumulatively rather than appearing from nowhere." "Prepare one deterministic nine-unit batch. Extraction bonuses have already happened at the ore block and cannot multiply this stage." ]
	quest.7311000000000005.title: "Separate the Valuable Fraction"
	quest.7311000000000005.quest_desc: ["Fermented Acid Wash changes how the mineral separates. The resulting precipitated material represents 13 recoverable nugget-equivalents from nine original traces." "Make the full deterministic batch; principal-metal yield never depends on hidden chance rolls." ]
	quest.7311000000000006.title: "Industrialize Fermented Leaching"
