	quest.7511000000000003.title: "Flocculant Separation"
	quest.7511000000000003.quest_desc: ["Basin mixing turns starch pulp into Flocculating Solution. Each later solution incorporates the prior tier's chemistry, creating an actual technology chain. This tier returns 50 mB of spent solution per 250 mB batch; regenerate it with fresh starch pulp instead of discarding it." "Produce one bucket. The pipe reward helps move the solution without making buckets the intended factory interface." ]
